OL,3,GNEWSACanadian pipe band crowned world
OL,4,Achampions after 'thrilling' contest
OL,5,
OL,6,FA pipe band from Canada has been
OL,7,Fcrowned World Pipe Band champions - the
OL,8,Ffirst time in 16 years that a band
OL,9,Foutside the UK has taken the honour.
OL,11,FThe Simon Fraser University pipe band
OL,12,Fwon the coveted title following the
OL,13,Ftwo-day event at Glasgow Green.
OL,15,FThe Field Marshal Montgomery pipe band
OL,16,Ffrom Lisburn, Northern Ireland, was
OL,17,Frunner-up, with the Peoples Ford
OL,18,FBoghall and Bathgate Caledonia band,
OL,19,Fcoming third.
OL,23,APub: 16-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
